025-05-03T17:27:21Z", "repo": "MiniShell42", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "24e5467f1e38d7a95a97c64b5999c5835d1ec865", "message": "parsing visualization", "created_at": "2025-05-03T17:15:51Z", "repo": "MiniShell42", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fabdd2feb8b42ca4e928bda334337c9114d902be", "message": "parsing ilk deneme", "created_at": "2025-05-03T17:09:30Z", "repo": "MiniShell42", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1ad5f0ca0daa2d7a8516f743616c86f049ada8de", "message": "parsing start", "created_at": "2025-05-03T15:29:01Z", "repo": "MiniShell42", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2d8cf67b3122048b619717a97b7408a793959a0e", "message": "parsing", "created_at": "2025-05-03T15:09:42Z", "repo": "MiniShell42", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ef7591aa60eb4279ccb052b1709bfe430af3a37a", "message": "refactor: Sadele\u015ftirme ve i\u015flevsellik iyile\u015ftirmeleri\n\n- Multiline deste\u011fini kald\u0131rmak zorunda kald\u0131m, \u00e7ok karma\u015f\u0131k, b\u00fct\u00fcn g\u00fcn\n  u\u011fra\u015ft\u0131m ama sinyalleri multiline i\u00e7inde bir t\u00fcrl\u00fc i\u015fleyemedim, bonus\n  branchte hala mevcut san\u0131r\u0131m.\n- Sinyal i\u015fleyicileri baya\u011f\u0131 d\u00fczenledim, senin dedi\u011fin gibi ctrl'c\n  i\u00e7inde readlinelar kullan\u0131l\u0131yor, clear screen ise sadece program\n  ba\u015flang\u0131c\u0131 ve biti\u015finde kullan\u0131l\u0131yor.\n- Parantez ve t\u0131rnak kontrollerinin sorumlulu\u011fu hala command'da,\n  lexer'\u0131n i\u015flemesine gerek kalmad\u0131.\n- Memory leak, edge case falan hepsine baya bakt\u0131m, norminettede sorun\n  yok.\n- Kod temizli\u011fini yapt\u0131m, baya\u011f\u0131 k\u0131sald\u0131 ve oynak yerleri g\u00fc\u00e7lendirdim.\n- \u015eu an commander ile i\u015fim bitti, parser bitene kadar geri d\u00f6nmeyece\u011fim.\n- Bonus yapar\u0131z diye anla\u015f\u0131rsak u\u011fra\u015f\u0131r\u0131z \u00fczerinde san\u0131r\u0131m.\n\nLexer'da yap\u0131lan de\u011fi\u015fiklikler:\n- Token i\u015fleme mekanizmas\u0131 yeniden d\u00fczenlendi, daha mod\u00fcler ve okunabilir hale getirildi\n- Quote handling iyile\u015ftirildi - tek ve \u00e7ift t\u0131rnak y\u00f6netimi i\u00e7in ayr\u0131 fonksiyonlar eklendi\n- Environment de\u011fi\u015fkenlerinin geni\u015fletilmesi (expansion) optimize edildi, $? \u00f6zel parametresi i\u00e7in destek eklendi\n- Token tipleri daha net tan\u0131mland\u0131, operat\u00f6r tespiti geli\u015ftirildi\n- Bellek y\u00f6netimi iyile\u015ftirildi, olas\u0131 memory leak'ler giderildi\n- Tokenization s\u00fcreci daha verimli hale getirildi\n- Debug ama\u00e7l\u0131 token yazd\u0131rma fonksiyonu eklendi", "created_at": "2025-05-01T22:51:25Z", "repo": "MiniShell42", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "374498b13a4e2e631738e413fe1292dea224a669", "message": "refactor: Sadele\u015ftirme ve i\u015flevsellik iyile\u015ftirmeleri\n\n- Multiline deste\u011fini kald\u0131rmak zorunda kald\u0131m, \u00e7ok karma\u015f\u0131k, b\u00fct\u00fcn g\u00fcn\n  u\u011fra\u015ft\u0131m ama sinyalleri multiline i\u00e7inde bir t\u00fcrl\u00fc i\u015fleyemedim, bonus\n  branchte hala mevcut san\u0131r\u0131m.\n- Sinyal i\u015fleyicileri baya\u011f\u0131 d\u00fczenledim, senin dedi\u011fin gibi ctrl'c\n  i\u00e7inde readlinelar kullan\u0131l\u0131yor, clear screen ise sadece program\n  ba\u015flang\u0131c\u0131 ve biti\u015finde kullan\u0131l\u0131yor.\n- Parantez ve t\u0131rnak kontrollerinin sorumlulu\u011fu hala command'da,\n  lexer'\u0131n i\u015flemesine gerek kalmad\u0131.\n- Memory leak, edge case falan hepsine baya bakt\u0131m, norminettede sorun\n  yok.\n- Kod temizli\u011fini yapt\u0131m, baya\u011f\u0131 k\u0131sald\u0131 ve oynak yerleri g\u00fc\u00e7lendirdim.\n- \u015eu an commander ile